### API_ISLAM - Interactive HTTP Test File
### Use this file with the "REST Client" extension in VS Code / JetBrains to test endpoints with 1 click!

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api/v1

### 1. Health Check
GET http://localhost:8000/health

### 2. Get All Quran Surahs
GET {{baseUrl}}/quran/surahs

### 3. Get Meccan Surahs Only
GET {{baseUrl}}/quran/surahs?revelation_type=Meccan

### 4. Get Surah Al-Fatiha (ID: 1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/quran/surah/1

### 5. Search Quran Verses (e.g. "الرحمن")
GET {{baseUrl}}/quran/search?q=الرحمن

### 6. Get Available Quran Reciters
GET {{baseUrl}}/quran/reciters

### 7. Get Adhkar Categories
GET {{baseUrl}}/adhkar/categories

### 8. Get Morning Adhkar
GET {{baseUrl}}/adhkar/category/morning

### 9. Get Evening Adhkar
GET {{baseUrl}}/adhkar/category/evening

### 10. Get Random Dhikr
GET {{baseUrl}}/adhkar/random

### 11. Get Hadith Collections
GET {{baseUrl}}/hadith/collections

### 12. Get 40 Nawawi Hadiths
GET {{baseUrl}}/hadith/collection/nawawi40

### 13. Get Random Hadith
GET {{baseUrl}}/hadith/random

### 14. Search Hadiths (e.g. "النيات")
GET {{baseUrl}}/hadith/search?q=النيات

### 15. Get Prayer Calculation Methods
GET {{baseUrl}}/prayer-times/methods

### 16. Calculate Prayer Times (Tunis Coordinates)
GET {{baseUrl}}/prayer-times/calculate?latitude=36.8065&longitude=10.1815&timezone=1&method=EGYPT

### 17. Calculate Prayer Times (Cairo Coordinates)
GET {{baseUrl}}/prayer-times/calculate?latitude=30.0444&longitude=31.2357&timezone=2&method=EGYPT
